# No X-Robots-Tag rules: Tom asked (2026-10-22) for preview hosts to be crawlable too.
# Every page's canonical points at https://www.vocom.ai, so search engines treat that as the original.

# Long cache for fingerprinted/static assets
/_astro/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=2592000
